            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Please try this:\n```lua\nvim.opt.statuscolumn = [[%C%s%=%{v:virtnum != 0 ? '' : (v:relnum == 0 ? '0' : (v:lnum < line('.') ? '+' : '-') . v:relnum)} ]]\n```",
